      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Graph/sequence approach on:\n-- who/what an account connects with and how densely\n-- what the account does over time\n--> help spot lone-wolf spam account and coordinate botnets alike",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Graph/sequence approach on:\n-- who/what an account connects with and how densely\n-- what the account does over time\n--> help spot lone-wolf spam account and coordinate botnets alike",
